\f7\fs30\fsmilli15200 \cf2 \cb7 \strokec2 customer
\f1\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 ; si env\'edas\'a0
\f7\fs30\fsmilli15200 \cf2 \cb7 \strokec2 customer
\f1\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 , ese cliente ser\'e1 el receptor de la factura.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
